{"unit_id":"Socialist-Sister__dsh-collaboration#feature-1","repo":"Socialist-Sister/dsh-collaboration","commit":"fd3e10e1ff3ba8c2ca10addde8326a4274a3a576","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collaboration 的功能「专家团队调度」：主代理可按身份名册雇佣一个或多个持久专家实例，并为克隆分配独立任务；后续可发送追问、查看状态或关闭实例。通过 team_call 等工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/tools/tool-team/src/index.ts:218","packages/tools/tool-team/src/index.ts:317"]}
{"unit_id":"Socialist-Sister__dsh-collaboration#feature-2","repo":"Socialist-Sister/dsh-collaboration","commit":"fd3e10e1ff3ba8c2ca10addde8326a4274a3a576","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collaboration 的功能「专家圆桌」：对同一问题并行召集名册中的多个专家进行一次性讨论，并返回各自的回应，适合收集不同角度的判断。通过 roundtable 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/tools/tool-team/src/index.ts:458"]}
{"unit_id":"Socialist-Sister__dsh-collaboration#feature-3","repo":"Socialist-Sister/dsh-collaboration","commit":"fd3e10e1ff3ba8c2ca10addde8326a4274a3a576","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collaboration 的功能「多模型答案比较」：把同一提示并发发送给指定或预设的多个 provider/model，并将各模型回答并列返回；模型路由需预先在 DSH 注册。通过 model_compare 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/tools/tool-model-compare/src/index.ts:62"]}
{"unit_id":"Socialist-Sister__dsh-collaboration#feature-4","repo":"Socialist-Sister/dsh-collaboration","commit":"fd3e10e1ff3ba8c2ca10addde8326a4274a3a576","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collaboration 的功能「图片视觉分析」：提供工作区图片路径和问题后，工具读取图片并交给配置的视觉模型，最后返回文字分析。支持 PNG、JPEG、WebP 与 GIF。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/tools/tool-vision/src/index.ts:133","packages/tools/tool-vision/src/index.ts:169"]}
{"unit_id":"Socialist-Sister__dsh-collaboration#feature-5","repo":"Socialist-Sister/dsh-collaboration","commit":"fd3e10e1ff3ba8c2ca10addde8326a4274a3a576","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-collaboration 的功能「粘贴图片收件箱」：协同模式的网页客户端拦截图片粘贴，并将图片上传为会话工作区文件，在草稿中插入路径提示，便于后续工具或专家读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/tools/tool-image-inbox/src/client.ts:240","packages/tools/tool-image-inbox/src/index.ts:190"]}
